  "description": "<p data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"584\">Deze HTC Vive Pro Controller is dé ideale vervanger of uitbreidingscontroller voor jouw Vive-, Vive Pro- of SteamVR-setup. Het apparaat verkeert <strong data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"340\">In Nette Staat</strong>: lichte gebruikssporen mogelijk, maar technisch volledig getest en 100% functioneel. Dankzij de nauwkeurige tracking, ergonomische vorm en stevige bouwkwaliteit is deze controller perfect voor intensieve VR-games en professionele toepassingen.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"836\">De Vive Pro Controller werkt samen met Lighthouse-trackingsystemen voor extreem nauwkeurige positionering. De grote touchpad, triggers en knoppen bieden veel controle en flexibiliteit — ideaal voor shooters, simulaties, VR-design en room-scale games.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"855\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<li data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<p data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"926\">🎮 <strong data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"890\">Zeer nauwkeurige tracking</strong> via Lighthouse (SteamVR Tracking)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"985\">\r\n<p data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"985\">🖐️ <strong data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"956\">Ergonomisch ontwerp</strong> voor langdurige VR-sessies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1041\">\r\n<p data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1041\">✨ <strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1019\">Multifunctioneel touchpad</strong> & gevoelige trigger</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1091\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1091\">🔋 <strong data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1066\">Sterke batterij</strong> met lange gebruiksduur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1154\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1154\">💼 Ideaal voor zowel gaming als professionele VR-projecten</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1195\">🔧 100% getest, volledig functioneel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1219\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1249\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1249\"><strong data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1232\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1288\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1288\"><strong data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1262\">Model:</strong> HTC Vive Pro Controller</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1309\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1309\"><strong data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1301\">Kleur:</strong> Blauw</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1369\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1369\"><strong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1325\">Tracking:</strong> SteamVR / Lighthouse Tracking (1.0 & 2.0)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1435\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1435\"><strong data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1385\">Sensoren:</strong> Accelerometer, gyroscoop, Lighthouse-ontvangers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1543\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1454\"><strong data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1452\">Bediening:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1543\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1484\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1484\">Groot klikbaar touchpad</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1498\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1498\">Trigger</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1516\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1516\">Gripknoppen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1543\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1543\">Menu & System-button</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1625\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1567\"><strong data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1565\">Connectiviteit:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1625\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1597\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1597\">Draadloos via Bluetooth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1625\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1625\">Opladen via micro-USB</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1749\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1650\"><strong data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1648\">Compatibiliteit:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1749\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1665\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1665\">HTC Vive</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1692\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1692\">HTC Vive Pro / Pro 2</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1724\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1724\">Valve Index base stations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1749\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1749\">SteamVR-ecosysteem</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1796\"><strong data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1768\">Meegeleverd:</strong> Controller (Blue Edition)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1831\"><strong data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1821\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 1 maand</h3>",
